[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537104576","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723#issuecomment-3537104576","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","id":3537104576,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S0-7A","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-15T23:45:34Z","updated_at":"2025-11-15T23:45:34Z","body":"The bug is technically a regression from #98675\r\nThe editor forces SpriteFrames to show when selecting node, but does not hide it when the resource is deleted.\r\n\r\nThe fix is rather hacky. A proper fix would be notifying the editor that editing conditions may have changed (in this case `handles()` will no longer return true).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537104576/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537142243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723#issuecomment-3537142243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","id":3537142243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S1IHj","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T00:08:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T00:09:15Z","body":"@KoBeWi I agree, that looks like the cleanest solution.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537142243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537374580","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723#issuecomment-3537374580","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","id":3537374580,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S2A10","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T02:05:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T02:05:45Z","body":"The `EditorPlugin` will be hidden by unexists `p_object` at the end of `edit_item()`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ef34c3d534a16b140aef0643ed2fa36f8e9d1612/editor/editor_node.cpp#L2845-L2847\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ef34c3d534a16b140aef0643ed2fa36f8e9d1612/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1177-L1187\r\n\r\nWhen we changed `SpriteFrames` of `AnimatedSprite2D`, the `sprite_frames_changed` event only notified `SpriteFramesEditor::_edit()`.\r\n\r\nShould we also notified `EditorNode::edit_item()`?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537374580/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537459846","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723#issuecomment-3537459846","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","id":3537459846,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S2VqG","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T02:39:48Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T02:39:48Z","body":"I tested calling `EditorNode::edit_item()` in `SpriteFramesEditor::_edit()`. it also can hide the `EditorPlugin` and prevent crash. Is it correct?\r\n\r\n```\r\ndiff --git a/editor/scene/sprite_frames_editor_plugin.cpp b/editor/scene/sprite_frames_editor_plugin.cpp\r\nindex 81b684fe5f..f57a2cf801 100644\r\n--- a/editor/scene/sprite_frames_editor_plugin.cpp\r\n+++ b/editor/scene/sprite_frames_editor_plugin.cpp\r\n@@ -1709,6 +1709,12 @@ void SpriteFramesEditor::_edit() {\r\n                return;\r\n        }\r\n        edit(animated_sprite->call(\"get_sprite_frames\"));\r\n+       EditorNode *editor_node = EditorNode::get_singleton();\r\n+       if (editor_node) {\r\n+               ObjectID current_id = editor_node->get_editor_selection_history()->get_current();\r\n+               Object *current_obj = current_id.is_valid() ? ObjectDB::get_instance(current_id) : nullptr;\r\n+               editor_node->edit_item(current_obj, SceneTreeDock::get_singleton());\r\n+       }\r\n }\r\n \r\n void SpriteFramesEditor::edit(Ref<SpriteFrames> p_frames) {\r\n\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537459846/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538816577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723#issuecomment-3538816577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","id":3538816577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S7g5B","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T14:36:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T14:47:57Z","body":"As I think KoBe meant, the ideal solution would be the editor handling the situation where the edit conditions changed by itself (in this case, the resource being cleared), otherwise, these types of workarounds will end up spreading across plugins.\r\n\r\nBut I could also be overthinking the solution here as well. :stuck_out_tongue:","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538816577/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3541363014","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723#issuecomment-3541363014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","id":3541363014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TFOlG","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T11:41:50Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T11:41:50Z","body":"@YeldhamDev \r\n\r\nI had a new idea. Please give me some advises.\r\n\r\n- When `EditorInspector` observed `_property_changed`, we can call `EditorNode::refresh_plugins()`\r\n- In `refresh_plugins()`, we call `edit_item()` to refresh plugins by current object.\r\n- If `SpriteFrames` is null, `edit_item()` will hide relevant plugin, so it won't crash.\r\n- If `SpriteFrames` is not null, `edit_item()` will show relevant plugin.\r\n\r\nThe key question is there is no unified `property_changed` signal, so we can only call `refresh_plugin()` in `EditorInspector::_property_changed()`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3541363014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3541899443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723#issuecomment-3541899443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","id":3541899443,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7THRiz","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T13:43:01Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T13:43:01Z","body":"I think it could be done with a new signal similar to `property_list_changed`. It should be emitted when an editing state of the object may change.\r\nThe current solution can still crash when you use undo/redo. It bypasses `_property_changed()`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3541899443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3545004484","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723#issuecomment-3545004484","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","id":3545004484,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TTHnE","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T04:41:27Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T04:41:27Z","body":"Added a `property_value_changed` signal into `object.cpp`.\r\n\r\n[spriteframes2.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8db22abb-4bcc-406f-98c8-b3f89be52a40)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3545004484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548369623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723#issuecomment-3548369623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","id":3548369623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Tf9LX","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T16:01:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T16:01:26Z","body":"There is a compilation error with windows, linux and android environments.\r\n\r\n```\r\n Error: editor/editor_node.cpp:1200:129: error: incompatible operand types ('EditorInspector *' and 'EditorNode *')\r\n 1200 |         Object *editor_owner = (is_node || Object::cast_to<MultiNodeEdit>(current_obj)) ? SceneTreeDock::get_singleton() : is_resource ? InspectorDock::get_inspector_singleton()\r\n      |                                                                                                                                        ^ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n 1201 |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    : this;\r\n      |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ~~~~\r\n```\r\n\r\nI need revert `(Object *)` part.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548369623/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]